{"channelId":"UCc9ynWT1EYv0IDg4K5tMjIA","row":["A.A.R.F. Volunteers",5490,"A.A.R.F. (All About Rescue and Fixin’ Inc.) is small group of volunteers with a passion for animals. Check out some of our adoptable pets and alumni videos here! It is our goal to save as many lives as we can from needless death.  We are a foster based animal rescue organization based in the beautiful Upper Cumberland region of Tennessee.  We pull animals from high risk situations, such as local animal shelters and local strays from counties who do not have the luxury of having an animal shelter. \n\nA.A.R.F. is operated out of our volunteers’ homes. We are ALWAYS in need of foster parents to help save more lives.  To become an A.A.R.F. foster parent, the only true requirement is that you love animals as much as we do, and that you would treat your foster animals as if they were your own.","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCc9ynWT1EYv0IDg4K5tMjIA","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCc9ynWT1EYv0IDg4K5tMjIA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:09:47.557Z","channelId":"UCc9ynWT1EYv0IDg4K5tMjIA","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"b9c091fc1d01a0bc852dc9537d49cb1478aea1e1aa44490d994c71d0de869855","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"c9470869582aed41533476fb2e030bf58890482b391eee0323ad27738c5b8767"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCc9ynWT1EYv0IDg4K5tMjIA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:09:47.557Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCc9ynWT1EYv0IDg4K5tMjIA","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":5490,"raw":"5.49K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCc9ynWT1EYv0IDg4K5tMjIA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:09:47.557Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":["animal rescue"],"relevantKeywords":["animal rescue"],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"animal rescue","relevant":false,"evidenceLevel